# The screenshots `cargo xtask demo --gui` takes, one per line: NAME THEME KEYS.
#
# Each opens dfdu-gui on the home fixture (fixtures/home.toml) at the fixture's time, waits for
# the scan, types KEYS one at a time (DFDU_GUI_SCREENSHOT_KEYS, crates/dfdu-gui/src/shot.rs),
# and writes out/NAME.png at twice the window's size (2200x1440). THEME is dark or light. In
# KEYS, `\s` is a space (marks the selected entry), `\n` is Enter, and `-` alone types nothing.
files          dark   i
tree           dark   Tl
map            dark   2
cleanup        dark   3
delete         dark   3d
largest        dark   5
